              "host": ["{{xcover_domain}}{{xcover_base_path}}{{xcover_partner_code}}"],
              "path": ["bookings", "{{booking_id}}", "cancel"]
            },
            "description": "Same preview call as folder 2, but this time captures `cancellation_id` from the response for the two-step flow documented at offers/api (confirm_cancellation). Confirmed live: preview always returns a real cancellation_id (fixtures/probe/cancel-preview.json, cancel-twostep-preview.json) — this wasn't exercised further in the initial build, which used the single-call preview:false path instead (folder 2, 'Cancel Booking (Confirm)'). Both paths work on this account; this is the one Cover Genius's docs describe as the intended two-step flow."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
